# Silo Terminal theme for Ghostty
# Based on silo-terminal.json (onehorizonai/silo-terminal)
#
# To use: save as ~/.config/ghostty/themes/silo-terminal, then set
#   theme = silo-terminal
# in your ghostty config. Or copy the contents below directly into
# your main ghostty config file.

